{"parentUuid":"ca59dc07-d52a-4293-a1a0-26f9c7dd10a5","isSidechain":false,"userType":"external","cwd":"/root","sessionId":"6821caff-8cb6-4a84-bed9-ac55d7c78dbd","version":"2.1.19","gitBranch":"","slug":"glistening-enchanting-church","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_vrtx_01Boaua5m8xJVNgmvNTx4cAU","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"SimPO Simple Preference Optimization reference-free reward loss function formula\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"[2405.14734] SimPO: Simple Preference Optimization with a Reference-Free Reward\",\"url\":\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2405.14734\"},{\"title\":\"SimPO: Simple Preference Optimization with a Reference-Free Reward Yu Meng1∗\",\"url\":\"https://arxiv.org/pdf/2405.14734\"},{\"title\":\"GitHub - princeton-nlp/SimPO: [NeurIPS 2024] SimPO: Simple Preference Optimization with a Reference-Free Reward\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/princeton-nlp/SimPO\"},{\"title\":\"SimPO: Simple Preference Optimization with a Reference-Free Reward | OpenReview\",\"url\":\"https://openreview.net/forum?id=3Tzcot1LKb\"},{\"title\":\"[PDF] SimPO: Simple Preference Optimization with a Reference-Free Reward | Semantic Scholar\",\"url\":\"https://www.semanticscholar.org/paper/SimPO:-Simple-Preference-Optimization-with-a-Reward-Meng-Xia/c3f1fae241a3c2449e675ab750873d800f95513c\"},{\"title\":\"SimPO: Simple Preference Optimization with a Reference-Free Reward | alphaXiv\",\"url\":\"https://www.alphaxiv.org/overview/2405.14734v3\"},{\"title\":\"Paper page - SimPO: Simple Preference Optimization with a Reference-Free Reward\",\"url\":\"https://huggingface.co/papers/2405.14734\"},{\"title\":\"SimPO: Simple Preference Optimization with a Reference-Free Reward\",\"url\":\"https://arxiv.org/html/2405.14734v1\"},{\"title\":\"SimPO: simple preference optimization with a reference- ...\",\"url\":\"https://dl.acm.org/doi/10.5555/3737916.3741862\"},{\"title\":\"NeurIPS Poster SimPO: Simple Preference Optimization with a Reference-Free Reward\",\"url\":\"https://neurips.cc/virtual/2024/poster/96741\"}]\n\nI found information about SimPO (Simple Preference Optimization). Here are the key findings:\n\n## SimPO Overview\n\nSimPO is a simpler yet more effective approach that uses the average log probability of a sequence as the implicit reward. This reward formulation better aligns with model generation and eliminates the need for a reference model, making it more compute and memory efficient.\n\n## Key Design Features\n\nSimPO introduces a target reward margin to the Bradley-Terry objective to encourage a larger margin between the winning and losing responses, further improving the algorithm's performance.\n\n## Loss Function Formula\n\nWhile the search results describe the conceptual approach, the specific mathematical formula appears in the paper. The SimPO objective is obtained by plugging Eq. (4) into Eq. (5), eliminating the need for a reference model and introducing a target reward margin · γ to help separating the winning and losing responses.\n\nThe reference-free reward formulation is the core innovation: instead of using a log ratio between current and reference model probabilities (as in DPO), SimPO directly uses the average log probability of sequences.\n\nFor the exact mathematical formulation of the loss function, you can access the full paper at https://arxiv.org/abs/2405.14734 or https://arxiv.org/pdf/2405.14734, where equations 4 and 5 are detailed.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"uuid":"96587cb0-e861-4dbd-88cc-74449b123a76","timestamp":"2026-01-29T05:08:16.207Z","toolUseResult":{"query":"SimPO Simple Preference Optimization reference-free reward loss function formula","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_vrtx_013yq7vzM9YvJDDwY7ErBfv8","content":[{"title":"[2405.14734] SimPO: Simple Preference Optimization with a Reference-Free Reward","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2405.14734"},{"title":"Si