Formula\n\nWhile the search results describe the conceptual approach, the specific mathematical formula appears in the paper. The SimPO objective is obtained by plugging Eq. (4) into Eq. (5), eliminating the need for a reference model and introducing a target reward margin · γ to help separating the winning and losing responses.\n\nThe reference-free reward formulation is the core innovation: instead of using a log ratio between current and reference model probabilities (as in DPO), SimPO directly uses the average log probability of sequences.\n\nFor the exact mathematical formulation of the loss function, you can access the full paper at https://arxiv.org/abs/2405.14734 or https://arxiv.org/pdf/2405.14734, where equations 4 and 5 are detailed."],"durationSeconds":10.258105454999997},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"ca59dc07-d52a-4293-a1a0-26f9c7dd10a5"}
